# The story's encore at level 10's goal, for `scripts/record-run --capture` (format:
# src/capture/timeline.rs). Start on the throne's stage:
#   NATHAN_START=333 scripts/record-run --capture encore.mp4 scripts/tours/encore.timeline 10
# Walk to the goal, then show off in the encore lap: call the band (Down) again and again
# (Giant Steps, fired up, melting, ...) and hop about. The Basie ending's last chord knocks Nat
# into the throne. ~40 s.

# The level's intro line.
wait 3

# To the goal flag: ENCORE!
hold Right 1.1
wait 0.6

# Call Giant Steps and float about.
tap Down
wait 0.4
repeat 2
  hold Space 160ms
  wait 250ms
  hold Space 160ms
  wait 0.9
end
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 400ms

# Fired up: dash back and forth.
tap Down
wait 0.3
hold Left 0.7
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 500ms
hold Left 0.5

# Melting, then more calls, hopping on the spot.
tap Down
wait 0.5
repeat 3
  hold Space 200ms
  wait 300ms
end
tap Down
wait 0.3
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 200ms
tap Down
wait 0.4
hold Space 160ms
wait 250ms
hold Space 160ms
wait 0.6
tap Down
# Back left of the throne, to fly into it.
hold Left 1.0

# The lap ends; the band plays its ending, the cymbal crash, FLUSH, to be continued, results.
wait 22
